      "text": "A photograph inside a clinic office showing four staff members in white coats/uniforms: one woman seated at a desk on the left, a standing man pointing toward a window while resting his hand on the back of a chair, a seated woman holding an open folder, and another seated woman typing at a desktop computer. Illustrates the AXIS 5 Operations section.",
